s=\"Film-info__content__heading\">Access screenings</h2>\n\n<div class=\"Film-info__content__content\">\n<p><strong>Sunday 22 March 20:25</strong>\n<br clear=\"none\">\nDescriptive Subtitles<br clear=\"none\">\nAudio Description</p>\n\n<p><strong>Monday 23 March 17:30</strong>\n<br clear=\"none\">\nDescriptive Subtitles<br clear=\"none\">\nAudio Description</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=flare-access#booking-access-tickets\" shape=\"rect\">Find out about booking tickets for access screenings</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- END COMPONENT: FILM_INFO --><!-- START COMPONENT: RICH_TEXT -->\n\n<h2 class=\"Visually__hidden\">Introduction</h2>\n\n<div class=\"Rich-text\">\n<p>Weard revels in the tortuous rhetoric and reality of contemporary trans life, directing her Sony Handicam Hi8 towards the unseemly and repulsive behaviour of cis and trans people alike. In Chapter iii, a young cis woman does everything in her power to stop her partner from transitioning. It’s a bold satire of female paranoia, biological essentialism and Mumsnet</p>\n\n<p>Jaye Hudson</p>\n\n<h3>Content advice</h3>\n\n<p>Contains scenes of graphic violence or injury and sex.</p>\n\n<p>Contains themes of suicide.</p>\n\n<p>Contains homophobic and transphobic attitudes and language.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- START COMPONENT: HOW TO BOOK -->\n\n<h2 class=\"Section__heading\">How to book</h2>\n\n<div class=\"Rich-text\">\n<p>BFI Flare tickets start from £10, with concessions available for many screenings and discounts for BFI Members. <a href=\"default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=flare-tickets\" shape=\"rect\">Booking information and ticket prices</a>.</p>\n\n<p>If you’re aged 16 to 25, sign up for free to <a href=\"default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=flare-25-and-under\" shape=\"rect\">BFI 25 and Under</a> for a chance to get £6 tickets to all screenings and events (subject to availability).</p>\n\n<div class=\"missed-out-message\">\n<h3>Missed out?</h3>\n\n<p>More tickets may become available for these screenings before and during the festival. <a href=\"default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=flare-tickets#extra-ticket-releases\" shape=\"rect\">Find out about extra ticket releases and standby queues</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- END COMPONENT: HOW TO BOOK --><!-- START SECTION: HIGHLIGHTS -->\n\n<div class=\"Section\">\n<h2 class=\"Section__heading\">Our programmers recommend...</h2>\n\n<div class=\"Highlights Highlights--three-cols\"><!-- START COMPONENT: HIGHLIGHT -->\n<div class=\"Highlight\">\n<div class=\"Highlight__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"Highlight__media\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Highlight__image\" src=\"https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/flare2026/films/560x315/a-sweetness-from-nowhere-01.jpeg\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"Highlight__content\">\n<h3 class=\"Highlight__heading\">A Sweetness from Nowhere</h3>\n\n<p class=\"Highlight__copy\">Ester Bergsmark ruminates on trans violence and healing, in this evocative and personal film.</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"Highlight__link\" href=\"default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=sweetness-from-nowhere-flare26\" shape=\"rect\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Read more about A Sweetness from Nowhere</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- END COMPONENT: HIGHLIGHT --><!-- START COMPONENT: HIGHLIGHT -->\n\n<div class=\"Highlight\">\n<div class=\"Highlight__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"Highlight__media\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Highlight__image\" src=\"https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/flare2026/films/560x315/serpents-skin-01.jpeg\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"Highlight__content\">\n<h3 class=\"Highlight__heading\">The Serpent’s Skin</h3>\n\n<p class=\"Highlight__copy\">Lesbian goths and vampiric trade abound in this punk, trans-led queer horror.</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"Highlight__link\" href=\"default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=serpents-skin-flare26\" shape=\"rect\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Read more about The Serpent’s Skin</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- END COMPONENT: HIGHLIGHT --><!-- START COMPONENT: HIGHLIGHT -->\n\n<div class=\"Highlight\">\n<div class=\"Highlight__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"Highlight__media\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Highlight__image\" src=\"https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/flare2026/films/560x315/we-are-pat-01.jpeg\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"Highlight__content\">\n<h3 class=\"Highlight__heading\">We Are Pat</h3>\n\n<p class=\"Highlight__copy\">Examining an androgynous character on Saturday Night Live, this uproarious, thoughtful film invites trans comedians to recreate and reclaim Pat.</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"Highlight__link\" href=\"default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=we-are-pat-flare26\" shape=\"rect\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Read more about We Are Pat</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- END COMPONENT: HIGHLIGHT --></div>\n</div>\n<!-- END SECTION: HIGHLIGHTS --></div>\n\n        </div>\n        \n        <div role=\"complementary\" aria-label=\"Secondary\" class=\"article-container secondary-linked-features\">\n        \n\n\n\n            <div class=\"secondary-linked-feature-div\" id=\"secondary-linked-feature-0\">\n                <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:av=\"http://www.audienceview.com/xml/email/\">\n<div class=\"menu-indicator-2\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        \n        </div>\n        \n    <div role=\"complementary\" aria-label=\"Tertiary\" class=\"article-container tertiary-linked-features\">\n    \n    <div class=\"tertiary-linked-features-div\" id=\"tertiary-linked-features-0\">\n    <!-- START COMPONENT: PROMOTION_TOP -->\n<div class=\"Promotion Promotion--dark Promotion--feature-top\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:av=\"http://www.audienceview.com/xml/email/\">\n<div class=\"Promotion__content\">\n<h2 class=\"Promotion__heading\">Minds</h2>\n\n<p class=\"Promotion__copy\">Reflections on art, politics and community.</p>\n<a class=\"Button Button--lig